    <innerclass refid="class_cell_obstacle_interface" prot="public">CellObstacleInterface</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for obstacle elements within a terrain cell. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class represents the obstacle component of a terrain cell. It tracks whether a cell contains an obstacle and if it is fully blocked. It is used by <ref refid="class_patch_applicator" kindref="compound">PatchApplicator</ref> to apply obstacle patches and check traversability in the landscape simulation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
